==Battleground==
*1 [[Rampage Cats (Enemy)|Rampage Cats]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s (100%) spawn, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 14.33~20 seconds<sup>430f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**4 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (100%) spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (100%) spawn, delay 3~9 seconds<sup>90f~270f</sup>.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 65 seconds<sup>1,950f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 68.67 seconds<sup>2,060f</sup>.
**6 [[Rampage Cats (Enemy)|Rampage Cats]] spawn, delay 3~4 seconds<sup>90f~120f</sup>.
**15 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (2,000%) spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 61 seconds<sup>1,830f</sup>.
**4 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Rampage Cats (Enemy)|Rampage Cats]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Stall the lone Rampage Cat at the beginning to upgrade your wallet and maximize your money. If you have any long distance units such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], you can try and stack a few of them which helps keep the Rain Ds at bay.

